 	std::string path = S3D::getSettingsFile("display.xml");
 
+	// Walnut (a console on a TV, the PS3): a fresh configuration starts on the game's own fastest
+	// preset, fullscreen at the desktop's size. The default settings ran the PS3 at 9 fps (or out
